{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to AIVX PUSH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive  into a brand new arcade puzzle game with addictive gameplay, pulsing music, and mesmerizing visuals!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In AIVX PUSH, you push blocks up from a tray which moves with the music. Form squares to make fuses, which clear all connected blocks. Build up your multiplier, and create Chains, Cascades, Massives, and more, to increase your score or complete challenges. It's deceptively simple, yet deep and challenging to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo includes previews of two gameplay modes: Arcade (timed 2-minute games) and Endless (play until you lose). Keep an eye out for more in the final release!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4090680?t=1760566467","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4090680?t=1760566467","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090680/5f680fea6ccbe01576c5cb8f99d55c84df84a495/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760566467","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090680/5f680fea6ccbe01576c5cb8f99d55c84df84a495/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760566467","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to AIVX PUSH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive  into a brand new arcade puzzle game with addictive gameplay, pulsing music, and mesmerizing visuals!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In AIVX PUSH, you push blocks up from a tray which moves with the music. Form squares to make fuses, which clear all connected blocks. Build up your multiplier, and create Chains, Cascades, Massives, and more, to increase your score or complete challenges. It's deceptively simple, yet deep and challenging to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo includes previews of two gameplay modes: Arcade (timed 2-minute games) and Endless (play until you lose). Keep an eye out for more in the final release!</p>","developers":["AIVX"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3662070","name":"AIVX PUSH"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090680/1b95fd98a3b6f485f44468a8e69022782d5cd0b7/header.jpg?t=1760566467","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4090680/1759912375/7aaed52d4ffa00adbb602739db79b7f86b0f8d1e/1760564948/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760566465","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4090680/1759912375/7aaed52d4ffa00adbb602739db79b7f86b0f8d1e/1760564948/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760566465","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4090680/1759912375/7aaed52d4ffa00adbb602739db79b7f86b0f8d1e/1760564948/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760566465","id":257212989,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257212989/movie480.mp4?t=1760566465","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257212989/movie_max.mp4?t=1760566465"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257212989/3e321d273c959f753993d1d7cb356b42068fb579/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760566465","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai